      "created_at": "2014-08-22T06:19:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've sent a message to those at &gt;G, but I'm sure they've been busy with GenCon, Tactics, WotC, and other stuff, so I thought I'd look here to see if someone has encountered this and maybe has an answer for me.</p><p>I was super pumped when I saw that WotC went up for pre-order. So much so, that I pre-ordered without really thinking. The ol' premature pre-order.</p><p>I know that my brother and some other friends are going to pre-order also, and would like to basically clump our orders into one in order to avoid paying for shipping multiple times. Is there a way to cancel and then re-order together? Is there a way to request all of our orders are shipped collectively?&nbsp;</p><p>I apologize if this should have been posted elsewhere.</p><p>Thanks for any help!</p>",
